// Agent Scheduler — benchmark measurement and reporting support.
//
// SYNTHETIC ONLY. Every population in this suite is generated by
// agent_scheduler::SyntheticLaboratory from an explicit seed and describes LOGICAL
// profiles, not physically present hardware or remote nodes. Every run is a
// single-process, in-memory measurement. No multi-node or multi-GPU claim is implied,
// measured, or made, and no physical scale is claimed from a synthetic population.
//
// NO TIMEOUTS. This suite contains no CTest TIMEOUT, no shell timeout wrapper, and no
// watchdog process. Every benchmark runs to completion naturally and reports the
// operation counts it actually executed. A correctness guard failure is reported by a
// non-zero process exit code, never by killing the run.
//
